e run but if we  put the pieces together take a look at  what some people from sonia said and  take a look at what Marvel and Sony are  doing with Morbius and spider-man it  seems very clear what's going to happen  we have vulture talking to Morbius in  his prison uniform in the Morbius teaser  trailer in prison scorpion asked vulture  about spider-man's identity and then in  the spider-man far from home post credit  scene spider-man's identity was revealed  to be Peter Parker and a vulture has  escaped from prison we can assume that  scorpion has as well and now all of a  sudden all of these people who want  revenge on spider-man know exactly who  he is and now we have an actor from the  sinister six saying that he's been  hearing things but cannot confirm or  deny yet so it does seem like the  sinister six is on its way possibly in  spider-man 3 if not in the next  spider-man film but certainly everything  is set up  kind of perfectly for them to appear in  spider-man 3 but let me know what you  think about this and the comments down  below would you like to see the sinister  six appear in spider-man 3 or would you  like a different villain let me know  what you think don't forget to like the  video and subscribe with notifications  turned on so you can stay up to date on  everything relating to Marvel as always  thank you all so much for watching  woof woof
 

